        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-161, Timeless Alder Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRK International is a new brand for us at Doorware.com but we had to add their <a href=\"/collections/rk-international\">extensive line of cabinet hardware</a> because we fell in love with the timelessness of their products. One Such example is the Alder Collection Cabinet Knob. What we love about this knob is how versatile it is--its classic design will look great in almost any setting. We imagine this as the perfect finishing touch to upscale rental homes, where versatility is a must for renters with different tastes. However, the Adler Cabinet Knob is so beautiful you probably will adorn your own cabinets with it. Available in 7 stunning finishes including black (pictured right), satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/alder-cabinet-pull-rk-international\"><b>Matching Alder Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Alder Collection Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
